  "NewsSubTitle": null,
  "NewsSummary": "A gesture of goodwill and brotherhood: Sheikh Mohammed Obaid (right), Honorary Consul General for Sri Lanka, receives a donation of US $62,000 for the construction of permanent accommodation for Sri Lankan tsunami victims from Shamsh Kassim-Lakha, Pr",
